Why did Jenny want to leave the wedding reception?
珍妮为什么要离开婚宴？

2
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:17,030
Why did Jenny want to leave the wedding reception?
珍妮为什么要离开婚宴？

3
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:25,730
Jeremy Hampden has a large circle of friends and is very popular at parties.
杰里米·汉普顿交际很广，在聚会上很受欢迎。

4
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:35,940
Everybody admires him for his great sense of humour--everybody, that is, except his six-year-old daughter, Jenny.
人人都钦佩他极强的幽默感——人人，也就是说，除了他六岁的女儿珍妮。

5
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:44,270
Recently, one of Jeremy's closest friends asked him to make a speech at a wedding reception.
最近，杰里米的一位密友请他在一次婚宴上讲话。

6
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,450
This is the sort of thing that Jeremy loves.
这正是杰里米喜欢做的事。

7
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:52,850
He prepared the speech carefully and
他认真准备了讲稿，

8
00:00:52,870 --> 00:00:54,390
went to the wedding with Jenny.
带着珍妮去参加婚礼。

9
00:00:55,320 --> 00:01:00,530
He had included a large number of funny stories in the speech and,
他在讲话里加进了大量有趣的故事，

10
00:01:00,550 --> 00:01:02,480
of course, it was a great success.
当然，讲话非常成功。

11
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,470
As soon as he had finished
他一讲完，

12
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:08,870
Jenny told him she wanted to go home.
珍妮就告诉他她想回家。

13
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:12,970
Jeremy was a little disappointed by this
杰里米对此有点失望，

14
00:01:12,990 --> 00:01:15,730
but he did as his daughter asked.
但他还是按女儿的要求做了。

15
00:01:16,470 --> 00:01:21,420
On the way home, he asked Jenny if she had enjoyed the speech.
回家的路上，他问珍妮喜不喜欢他的讲话。

16
00:01:22,710 --> 00:01:26,080
To his surprise she said she hadn't.
使他吃惊的是她说不喜欢。

17
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:34,170
Jeremy asked her why this was so and she told him that she did not like to
杰里米问她为什么，她告诉他说她不喜欢

18
00:01:34,190 --> 00:01:36,550
see so many people laughing at him!
看到那么多人笑话他！
